      "statement": "The scheduler's `_launch` routes `task` values `reconcile`, `baby_sit`, `background_tasks`, `session_cost`, `agent_cost`, `thread_feedback`, `expedited_review`, workspace refresh, and human-review deadlines to their handlers, plus falls through to `launch_scheduled_agent_run(schedule_id)` when no task matches.",
      "evidence": [
